  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since Vrchat has (probably) the largest amount of eye tracking users of any game, quad views would be really really helpful for optimization and higher resolution. Quad views support allows headsets like the meta quest pro and varjo aero (and more) to use whats called dynamic foveated rendering, which is a feature that only renders where you are looking in full resolution, while the rest is downscaled by a lot. \n\nThis would also optimize the game a lot for us players with lower quality pc hardware. Even tho im not a dev, it is from my understanding not too hard to add quad views to your game. Its just an idea to make the expirience on pc a bit better, thank you for yoir time",
